# Core Conventions

- Use JavaScript JSX (`.jsx`) - do not convert to TypeScript unless asked
- Import alias: `@/*` maps to `src/*`
- Use named exports for components
- Merge Tailwind classes with `cn()` from `@/components/utils`
- Put static mock data in `src/data/*`
- Put shared UI primitives in `src/components/ui/*`
- Put reusable UI in `src/components/*`
- Put page components in `src/pages/*`
- Keep app routing / top-level composition in `src/App.jsx`
- Put local images/icons/static files in `public/assets/*`, not `src/assets/*`
- Brand name in UI: **JB Fit Blueprint**
